          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We can introduce a new variable <span class=\"math\">[MATH: t = p^2]</span> and then rewrite the trinomial as a quadratic in terms of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: t\\mathbin{:}]</span></p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2p^{4} + 5p^{2} + 3|=; 2(p^{2})^{2} + 5p^{2} + 3|=; 2t^{2} + 5t + 3]</span></p><p>Now, we can factor the quadratic, and then rewrite the final expression in terms of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: p\\mathbin{:}]</span></p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2t^{2} + 5t + 3|=; (t + 1)(2t + 3)|=; (p^{2} + 1)(2p^{2} + 3)]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We can introduce a new variable [MATH: t = p^2] and then rewrite the trinomial as a quadratic in terms of [MATH: t\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: 2p^{4} + 5p^{2} + 3|=; 2(p^{2})^{2} + 5p^{2} + 3|=; 2t^{2} + 5t + 3]\n\nNow, we can factor the quadratic, and then rewrite the final expression in terms of [MATH: p\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: 2t^{2} + 5t + 3|=; (t + 1)(2t + 3)|=; (p^{2} + 1)(2p^{2} + 3)]",
