        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nFactor [MATH: 2p^4 + 5p^2 + 3.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe can introduce a new variable [MATH: t = p^2] and then rewrite the trinomial as a quadratic in terms of [MATH: t\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: 2p^{4} + 5p^{2} + 3|=; 2(p^{2})^{2} + 5p^{2} + 3|=; 2t^{2} + 5t + 3]\n\nNow, we can factor the quadratic, and then rewrite the final expression in terms of [MATH: p\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: 2t^{2} + 5t + 3|=; (t + 1)(2t + 3)|=; (p^{2} + 1)(2p^{2} + 3)]"
      },
